*.sql
# ...but schema.sql (the full bootstrap) and the per-feature
# *-schema.sql files ARE the schema documentation and belong in the repo.
# Without this negation `git add -A` skips them silently and a feature
# ships with no way to create its tables. Data dumps stay ignored.
!*schema.sql

